Package: a-simple-autoclicker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Steven
Depends: libadwaita-1-0, libgtk-4-1, libx11-6, libxtst6
Description: Simple GTK autoclicker for Linux
 Repeat mouse clicks or recorded keyboard actions with configurable intervals,
 duration and action limits, fixed click positions, presets, and tray support.
